  <item>
    <title>47. 在创造美好回忆这方面，假期比工作更高效！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b3e7c9772ac2295b083387</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b3e7c9772ac2295b083387</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Mar 2026 15:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><strong><span>本期导语</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>这一期，我们聊聊刚刚过去的2月</span></p><span></span><p><span>2月是关于春节假期，关于家人，</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于团聚，关于离别，也关于重新出发。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们都经历了一些调整与适应，趁着假期，整理好复杂的心绪，也抓紧时间，创造一些奇妙的回忆。</span></p><span></span><p><span>毕竟，假期可是电影之外延长生命的又一利器！</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>时间戳</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a> 男朋友为新工作搬家异地，阿君回到一人独居生活有什么感受？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="414">06:54</a> 春节假期三件套：看电影，打麻将，煮火锅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="808">13:28</a> 家有一老，如有一宝：听奶奶讲过去的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1186">19:46</a> 带外国男朋友回家过年会出什么bug?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1769">29:29</a> 过年回家但住酒店是什么样的体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2648">44:08</a> 不会说中文的老外在乡下如何social?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3519">58:39</a> 阿君和闺蜜的快乐惠州海边游</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4074">01:07:54</a> 海岛上的悠闲时光（附避雷指南）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4499">01:14:59</a> Xingting的港澳之旅：威尼斯人这样的魔幻空间到底是谁在去啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4873">01:21:13</a> 在香港意外住进重庆大厦：殖民时代的畸形产物</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><span>【进群】</span></p><span></span><p><span>VX：dxt5310528（备注：理所不应当）</span></p>]]></description>
