  <item>
    <title>46. 那些能让你笑出来的，就是好作品！假期影视书单分享</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6988601ca22480add61e1d2a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6988601ca22480add61e1d2a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Feb 2026 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><strong><span>本期导语</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>最近闲下来的Xingting又哐哐补充了很多精神食粮</span></p><span></span><p><span>正好春节将近，我们整理出了最推荐的几部作品供大家假期阅读观看。</span></p><span></span><p><span>都是在现实有点累的时候，还能让人感到温暖和快乐的好东西！</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>Highlights</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《流俗地》 黎紫书</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">0:55</a> 盲女银霞和那些如纸张般被雨水泡得发皱的回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="722">12:02</a> 多语种、多民族融合的环境让马来人在任何地方都不感到隔阂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="821">13:41</a> “吾若不写，无人能写”：写作一部长篇需要的决心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1231">20:31</a> 没有出路的女性：银霞只能作为被害者和被拯救者吗？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《素食者》 韩江</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1339">22:19</a> 当一个女人决定吃素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1595">26:35</a> 为欲望发狂的姐夫和对性事坦然的小姨子</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《春夜》 韩志旼/丁海寅</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a> 带娃之父和有主之花之间的背德爱欲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1979">32:59</a> 成年人的顶级拉扯：韩剧如何塑造令人心动的氛围感？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《那你来做做看啊》 竹内凉真/夏帆</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2141">35:41</a> 化石男和委屈女的“完美爱情”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2421">40:21</a> 已经过于膨胀或压缩的自我要如何恢复正常？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2779">46:19</a> 好运并不总随着改变到来，但想要的生活已经在路上！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2875">47:55</a> 韩剧的氛围感和日剧的烟火气，请跟随心境的变化各取所需~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3072">51:12</a> 延伸推荐：《热点》和《初吻》也很不错！</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><span>你最近有没有发现什么好看的作品呢？欢迎在评论区分享给我们哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【进群】</span></p><span></span><p><span>VX：dxt5310528（备注：理所不应当）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>シェイプシフター_This Is Last</span></p><span></span><p><span>Spring Rain_Oscar Dunbar</span></p>]]></description>
